          "anchor": "stored-in-the-macos-keychain",
          "heading": "Stored in the macOS Keychain",
          "text": "Your key goes into the macOS Keychain, the same place the system keeps your other passwords. It is protected by your login and encrypted at rest, and no other user account on the Mac can read it.\n\nIf you used an early version of EnviousWispr, your key may have started out in an older file store. The app moves the key into the Keychain the next time it is used, and clears the old file afterwards.",
