          "text": "- It is never written to logs.\n- It is never included in usage or crash data.\n- It goes nowhere except the provider you chose, to prove the request is yours.",
          "url": "https://enviouswispr.com/help/api-key-security/#where-your-key-does-and-does-not-go"
