          "heading": "Removing a key",
          "text": "Clear the key. Open Settings, select AI Polish, choose your provider, and click Clear beside the key field. The stored key goes with it.\n\nYou can also revoke the key from your provider's own dashboard at any time, which takes effect immediately regardless of what EnviousWispr does.",
          "url": "https://enviouswispr.com/help/api-key-security/#removing-a-key"
