          "heading": "Alternative polish options",
          "text": "If Apple Intelligence is out of reach on your Mac, you can choose a different way to clean up your dictated text. Pick EG-1, S1-mini, or a downloaded Ollama model to keep everything on your Mac, or enter your own API key for OpenAI, Gemini, or Claude.",
          "url": "https://enviouswispr.com/help/apple-intelligence-not-available/#alternative-polish-options"
